{% extends "_base.txt.j2" %}
{% set kicker = "SUPPLY INVARIANT BREACH" %}
{% set headline = "Token Supply Audit Failed" %}
{% block body %}
The supply auditor detected a divergence between issued units and total circulating supply. This is a critical correctness signal and warrants immediate investigation.

  Delta:          {{ delta }}
  Net supply:     {{ net_supply }}
  Circulating:    {{ circulating }}
  Detected at:    {{ detected_at }}
  Audit type:     {{ audit_type }}
  Auto-lockdown:  {{ auto_lockdown }}

Investigate: {{ registry_ui_url }}#/admin
CLI (Frame A; substitute your node's registry container): docker logs agentvault_registry_a | grep SUPPLY-BREACH

The supply auditor will continue logging at 60s intervals while the breach persists.
This email is throttled (min 5min between repeats).
{% endblock %}
